## Single Image with Description

![Aurora](https://picsum.photos/700/400?random=20){caption="Aurora Borealis" desc="The aurora borealis, also known as the northern lights, is a natural light display in Earth's sky, predominantly seen in high-latitude regions around the Arctic and Antarctic."}

## Instructions

Click any image to open the lightbox.

**Keyboard shortcuts:**
- `←` / `→` — Previous / Next
- `+` / `-` — Zoom in / out
- `0` — Reset zoom
- `ESC` — Close
- Click image in lightbox — Toggle 2x zoom